<section class="sensol-warranty-detail-section">
  <div class="sensol-warranty-detail">
    <div class="sensol-warranty-detail__divider"></div>

    <div class="sensol-warranty-detail__block">
      <p class="sensol-warranty-detail__num">01</p>
      <h2 class="sensol-warranty-detail__title">What is covered</h2>
      <div class="sensol-warranty-detail__body">
        <p>Sensol Fitness warrants to the original purchaser that each product &mdash; FLEX AIR, FLEX PRO, RS03, and RS03 PRO &mdash; will be free from defects in materials and workmanship under normal use for the coverage periods below, from the date of delivery.</p>
        <div class="sensol-warranty-detail__table-wrap">
          <table class="sensol-warranty-detail__table">
            <thead><tr><th>Coverage Tier</th><th>Duration</th><th>Applies To</th><th>Remedy</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr><td><strong>Frame</strong></td><td>5 years</td><td>Aluminium alloy mainframe, rail tracks, carriage platform</td><td>Repair or replacement</td></tr>
              <tr><td><strong>Electronics</strong></td><td>3 years</td><td>Magnetic resistance motor, control board, power supply, sensor array</td><td>Repair or replacement</td></tr>
              <tr><td><strong>Mechanical</strong></td><td>2 years</td><td>Resistance module, pulley system, spring mechanism, bearings</td><td>Repair or replacement</td></tr>
              <tr><td><strong>Wear Parts</strong></td><td>1 year</td><td>Cables, reformer straps, handle grips, upholstery, footbar padding</td><td>Replacement</td></tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="sensol-warranty-detail__block">
      <p class="sensol-warranty-detail__num">02</p>
      <h2 class="sensol-warranty-detail__title">What is not covered</h2>
      <div class="sensol-warranty-detail__body">
        <p>This warranty does not extend to:</p>
        <ul class="sensol-warranty-detail__exclusions">
          <li>Improper assembly not performed by an authorised Sensol technician</li>
          <li>Commercial use without a commercial-use agreement</li>
          <li>Modification or tampering with electrical or mechanical systems</li>
          <li>Misuse, abuse, negligence, or use contrary to the User Manual</li>
          <li>Exposure to outdoor conditions or excessive moisture</li>
          <li>Use of non-Sensol accessories or replacement parts</li>
          <li>Normal cosmetic wear (scratches, discolouration, fading)</li>
          <li>Damage during relocation not by an authorised provider</li>
          <li>Force majeure events (flood, fire, earthquake, power surge)</li>
          <li>Products from unauthorised resellers or second-hand sources</li>
          <li>Consumables after opening (cleaning products, lubricants)</li>
          <li>Products with removed or altered serial numbers</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="sensol-warranty-detail__highlight">
          <p class="sensol-warranty-detail__highlight-label">Register your product</p>
          <p class="sensol-warranty-detail__highlight-text">Activate your warranty within <strong>30 days</strong> of delivery via the <a class="sensol-warranty-detail__highlight-link" href="/pages/app">Sensol App</a> or <a class="sensol-warranty-detail__highlight-link" href="mailto:support@sensolfitness.com.au">support@sensolfitness.com.au</a>. Unregistered products remain covered under statutory consumer guarantees.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="sensol-warranty-detail__block">
      <p class="sensol-warranty-detail__num">03</p>
      <h2 class="sensol-warranty-detail__title">How to make a warranty claim</h2>
      <div class="sensol-warranty-detail__body">
        <ol class="sensol-warranty-detail__steps">
          <li class="sensol-warranty-detail__step"><span class="sensol-warranty-detail__step-num">1</span><div><h4>Document the issue</h4><p>Take clear photographs and, where helpful, video. Note your serial number &mdash; located on the underside of the carriage platform.</p></div></li>
          <li class="sensol-warranty-detail__step"><span class="sensol-warranty-detail__step-num">2</span><div><h4>Contact Sensol Support</h4><p>Email <strong>support@sensolfitness.com.au</strong> with your order number, serial number, a description of the issue, and supporting images or video. Our team responds within 1&ndash;2 business days.</p></div></li>
          <li class="sensol-warranty-detail__step"><span class="sensol-warranty-detail__step-num">3</span><div><h4>Assessment &amp; authorisation</h4><p>Our technical team reviews your submission. If covered, we issue a Return Authorisation (RA) number and coordinate repair, replacement, or servicing.</p></div></li>
          <li class="sensol-warranty-detail__step"><span class="sensol-warranty-detail__step-num">4</span><div><h4>Resolution</h4><p>We dispatch replacement parts with installation guidance, arrange an authorised technician visit, or coordinate unit return and replacement. Sensol covers outbound shipping for approved claims within Australia.</p></div></li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="sensol-warranty-detail__block">
      <p class="sensol-warranty-detail__num">04</p>
      <h2 class="sensol-warranty-detail__title">Limitations &amp; statutory rights</h2>
      <div class="sensol-warranty-detail__body">
        <p>This warranty is provided by Dute Fitness (Australia) Pty. Ltd. (trading as Sensol Fitness). Our liability is limited to repair or replacement of the defective product or component. We are not liable for incidental, consequential, or indirect damages.</p>
        <p>This warranty is <strong>in addition to</strong> your rights under the <em>Australian Consumer Law</em> (for Australian purchases) and applicable consumer protection laws. You are entitled to a replacement or refund for a major failure.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="sensol-warranty-detail__block">
      <p class="sensol-warranty-detail__num">05</p>
      <h2 class="sensol-warranty-detail__title">International purchases</h2>
      <div class="sensol-warranty-detail__body">
        <p>For products purchased via <strong>sensolfitness.com</strong> (United States), warranty terms are governed by local consumer protection laws, with equivalent coverage globally. Contact <strong>support@sensolfitness.com</strong> for US inquiries. International claims may be subject to additional freight charges.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="sensol-warranty-detail__block">
      <p class="sensol-warranty-detail__num">06</p>
      <h2 class="sensol-warranty-detail__title">Policy updates</h2>
      <div class="sensol-warranty-detail__body">
        <p>Sensol Fitness reserves the right to update this policy. Updates apply to products purchased on or after the revision date. Prior purchases are governed by the terms in effect at purchase.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}{"name":"SENSOL Warranty Detail","tag":"section","class":"sensol-warranty-detail-section","settings":[],"presets":[{"name":"SENSOL Warranty Detail"}]}{% endschema %}

{%- style -%}
/* FIX #2 + #3: larger fonts + proper mobile layout */
.sensol-warranty-detail-section{margin:0;padding:0;background:#F7F4F0}
.sensol-warranty-detail-section .sensol-warranty-detail{max-width:1040px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 2rem 100px;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif}
.sensol-warranty-detail-section .sensol-warranty-detail__divider{width:48px;height:1px;background:#D4CEC6;margin:0 auto 100px}
.sensol-warranty-detail-section .sensol-warranty-detail__block{margin-bottom:88px}
.sensol-warranty-detail-section .sensol-warranty-detail__num{font-size:1.25rem;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:0.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#B5ADA4;margin-bottom:0.5rem}
.sensol-warranty-detail-section .sensol-warranty-detail__title{font-size:clamp(2rem,3vw,2.75rem);font-weight:500;letter-spacing:-0.01em;margin-bottom:2rem;color:#1A1816}
.sensol-warranty-detail-section .sensol-warranty-detail__body{font-size:1.5rem;font-weight:500;color:#8A8279;line-height:1.655}
.sensol-warranty-detail-section .sensol-warranty-detail__body p{margin-bottom:1.25rem}
.sensol-warranty-detail-section .sensol-warranty-detail__table-wrap{overflow-x:auto;margin:1.5rem 0}
.sensol-warranty-detail-section .sensol-warranty-detail__table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:1.375rem;font-weight:500}
.sensol-warranty-detail-section .sensol-warranty-detail__table th{text-align:left;font-weight:600;font-size:1.125rem;letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#1A1816;padding:18px 18px;border-bottom:1px solid #D4CEC6;white-space:nowrap}
.sensol-warranty-detail-section .sensol-warranty-detail__table td{padding:20px 18px;border-bottom:1px solid #D4CEC6;color:#8A8279;line-height:1.65;font-size:1.375rem}
.sensol-warranty-detail__table tr:last-child td{border-bottom:none}
.sensol-warranty-detail-section .sensol-warranty-detail__exclusions{list-style:none;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:0.75rem 2.5rem}
.sensol-warranty-detail-section .sensol-warranty-detail__exclusions li{font-size:1.25rem;font-weight:500;color:#8A8279;padding:0.75rem 0 0.75rem 1.5rem;position:relative;border-bottom:1px solid #D4CEC6}
.sensol-warranty-detail__exclusions li::before{content:'\2014';position:absolute;left:0;color:#B5ADA4;font-weight:500}
.sensol-warranty-detail-section .sensol-warranty-detail__highlight{background:#1A1816;color:#F7F4F0;padding:3rem 2.5rem;margin:2.5rem 0}
.sensol-warranty-detail-section .sensol-warranty-detail__highlight-label{font-size:1.25rem;letter-spacing:0.15em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#B5ADA4;margin-bottom:0.75rem}
.sensol-warranty-detail-section .sensol-warranty-detail__highlight-text{font-size:1.5rem;font-weight:500;line-height:1.65;max-width:650px}
.sensol-warranty-detail-section .sensol-warranty-detail__highlight-link{color:#F7F4F0;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px;text-decoration-thickness:0.5px;text-decoration-color:rgba(247,244,240,0.3)}
.sensol-warranty-detail-section .sensol-warranty-detail__steps{list-style:none}
.sensol-warranty-detail-section .sensol-warranty-detail__step{display:flex;gap:2rem;padding:2rem 0;border-bottom:1px solid #D4CEC6}
.sensol-warranty-detail__step:first-child{padding-top:0}
.sensol-warranty-detail__step:last-child{border-bottom:none;padding-bottom:0}
.sensol-warranty-detail-section .sensol-warranty-detail__step-num{font-size:2.5rem;font-weight:400;line-height:1;color:#B5ADA4;flex-shrink:0;min-width:64px;text-align:right}
.sensol-warranty-detail-section .sensol-warranty-detail__step h4{font-size:1.5rem;font-weight:500;color:#1A1816;margin-bottom:0.35rem}
.sensol-warranty-detail-section .sensol-warranty-detail__step p{font-size:1.25rem;font-weight:500;color:#8A8279;line-height:1.65}

/* Tablet */
@media(max-width:1040px){.sensol-warranty-detail-section 
  .sensol-warranty-detail-section .sensol-warranty-detail__exclusions{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .sensol-warranty-detail-section .sensol-warranty-detail__table{font-size:1.25rem}
  .sensol-warranty-detail__table th,.sensol-warranty-detail-section .sensol-warranty-detail__table td{padding:12px 12px}
}
/* Mobile */
@media(max-width:749px){.sensol-warranty-detail-section 
  .sensol-warranty-detail-section .sensol-warranty-detail{padding:0 1.5rem 64px}
  .sensol-warranty-detail-section .sensol-warranty-detail__block{margin-bottom:56px}
  .sensol-warranty-detail-section .sensol-warranty-detail__divider{margin-bottom:64px}
  .sensol-warranty-detail-section .sensol-warranty-detail__body{font-size:1.5rem}
  .sensol-warranty-detail-section .sensol-warranty-detail__step{flex-direction:column;gap:0.5rem;padding:1.75rem 0}
  .sensol-warranty-detail-section .sensol-warranty-detail__step-num{text-align:left;font-size:1.5rem;width:auto;margin-bottom:0.25rem}
  .sensol-warranty-detail-section .sensol-warranty-detail__exclusions li{font-size:1.125rem}
  .sensol-warranty-detail-section .sensol-warranty-detail__highlight{padding:2rem 1.5rem}
  .sensol-warranty-detail-section .sensol-warranty-detail__highlight-text{font-size:1.5rem}
  .sensol-warranty-detail-section .sensol-warranty-detail__table{font-size:1.25rem}
  .sensol-warranty-detail__table th,.sensol-warranty-detail-section .sensol-warranty-detail__table td{padding:12px 10px}
}
{%- endstyle -%}
